<Project>
  <!--
    ADR 0098 §1: the single version of everything HackerOS publishes (SDK, platform, base apps,
    HackerOs.App.Build, HackerOs.Ecosystem.Host, templates). Imported by Directory.Build.props, so
    every project of the solution carries it; Platform/Packaging.props inherits it.

    Before the SDK 1.0 freeze: 0.9.0-preview.<n>. Since the freeze (chantier v3/15, ADR 0114):
    SemVer (ADR 0019) - patch with no API change, minor for an addition, major for a breaking
    change of the SDK. PublicAPI.Unshipped.txt of each library says which one a release needs.
    1.1.0 (chantier v3.1/4-sdk-1-1, ADR 0117 §5): window title, window geometry opt-out, user
    accounts and passwd, per-user default handlers.
    1.2.0 (chantier exec/10-final, ADR 0132 §2): process limits, niceness, OOM score adjustment,
    HackBackground and its analyzer, HackWireContext for remote gateways, all published once at the
    end of the exec series.

    The App SDK version an app is compiled against comes from this number (HackerOsSdk.Version), and
    the manifest generator writes it as the app's sdkCompatibility.minimumVersion (ADR 0098 §3).
  -->
  <PropertyGroup>
    <HackerOsVersion>1.2.0</HackerOsVersion>
  </PropertyGroup>
</Project>
